        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "That city Ayodhya accommodates groups of danseuses and theatrical personnel, and she is surrounded everywhere with the gardens and brakes of mango trees, and her wide fort-wall is like her cincture ornament. [1-5-12]"
      }
